Package: climatech
Title: Functions package for weather stations data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Download and read data from weather stations of the National Institute of 
            Agricultural Technology (INTA), available in the Agricultural Information 
            and Management System (SIGA), using each station's identifier. It includes 
            functions to summarize the shelter temperature of one or more stations and 
            plot their monthly average. It also provides sample data to explore and test the 
            package's functions.
License: `use_mit_license()`, `use_gpl3_license()` or friends to pick a
    license
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/moravilar/climatech
BugReports: https://github.com/moravilar/climatech/issues
